# C2 panic-stack call chain, symbolized from disk (4.4.4) — evidence

# Purpose: §45 pinned the trap (quickjs.c:1494, `js_rc`'s `container_of`) and §46 pinned the last
# allocator event before it (`Mx size=ff0`), but the eight in-DLL frames both logs recorded were never
# turned into a named chain: §45's own boundary says "the middle of the chain is inferred". This log does
